<title>UK: Bco Bozano Simonsen prices $100 mln 8-yr bond, call.</title>
<headline>Bco Bozano Simonsen prices $100 mln 8-yr bond, call.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond, announced earlier by lead manager Credit Lyonnais, has been priced.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANCO BOZANO SIMONSEN</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	COUPON     9.125     MATURITY    20.MAR.05</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.9645   PAY DATE    20.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  75 BP     REOFFER    99.9645   SPREAD	+270 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	B1	  LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 1-10	SALE LIMITS US/UK/BR</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    25 BP     SELL CONC   50 BP</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND FIVE YEAR U.S. TREASURY</p>
<p> NOTES	*PUT AND CALL ON 20.MAR.02 AT PAR</p>
<p>		ISSUED OFF AN EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
